# pokoin-marketplace SSH

The Oracle VM that runs marketplace Postgres and `api.pokoin.com` is named **pokoin-marketplace** (`130.61.251.250`, user `ubuntu`).

SSH: `ssh pokoin-marketplace`

Do not call that machine honcho, honcho-personal, or oracle-honcho. Those were leftover SSH aliases and are removed.

Honcho still means the Honcho MCP / AES / DSH memory stack, not this VM.
